        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2022-08-23T01:04:40.208Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It’s time for zany hijinks with Wager Master on an island filled with spirits and shifting biomes! What does the blue impish scalawag have in store for the heroes this week?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/3bc6410e84a911ed98f3c813fc11f0d09574531f.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/3bc6410e84a911ed98f3c813fc11f0d09574531f\" title=\"20220822205321_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3bc6410e84a911ed98f3c813fc11f0d09574531f_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20220822205321_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"8wMVyfQMGwCVhRwHzdGqZVKooTJ\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3bc6410e84a911ed98f3c813fc11f0d09574531f_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3bc6410e84a911ed98f3c813fc11f0d09574531f_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3bc6410e84a911ed98f3c813fc11f0d09574531f_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3bc6410e84a911ed98f3c813fc11f0d09574531f_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20220822205321_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 392 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Don’t have much strategy to offer here other than hope you get lucky like I did and he doesn’t flip <em>Who Are You Fighting?</em> back to face up. I just beat him down to zero by the third round. Trying to get all the heroes’ HP even or run his deck out just takes too much micro-managing IMO. Good luck!</p>",
