      {
        "id": 247487,
        "name": "",
        "username": "The_Justifier",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-08-24T00:26:51.301Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Migrant P has stated he doesn’t stack the decks for these or anything, so I figured there was a chance Winning To The Odds would work on round 1, or surely on round 2.  The odds of both “1 damage to everyone” biomes showing up in a row are pretty good, but I still failed to anticipate it.</p>\n<p>Fortunately, plan B usually works, and this wasn’t one of the exceptions.  Hiding in the Eternal Timber didn’t work out so good for Increased Stakeser Master; he got off a few cutting remarks at our expense, but the thick skin of a Thorathian Monolith ensured his words couldn’t hurt us much.  Scholar Turned Loose, Mainstay dropped a couple Hammers, and the little blue guy walked away with a lot of black spots.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2022-08-24T00:26:51.301Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
