        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2022-08-24T22:13:39.322Z",
        "cooked": "<p>He can be quite a slog, but personally I find it more satisfying to achieve an alt-win condition and beat him at his own game as it were.</p>\n<p>I have experienced both the auto-win and auto-loss, before the change was made to achievements if I remember patch notes correctly. That’s how I got both play-no-cards and use-no-powers at once.</p>",
