      {
        "id": 247552,
        "name": "",
        "username": "The_Justifier",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-08-25T13:48:12.915Z",
        "cooked": "<p>IMO the worst thing about WM, other than his name, is the fact that he only has two win conditions in his deck, but can usually also be beaten up like any other villain.  I think every “game” he plays should offer a way to win and a way to lose, and winning the whole game requires beating, say, three of his challenges before you lose five of them, or the like.  Several Cauldron villains work along these lines.</p>",
